\,\\,\\,{{x}^{4}+0{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-4{x}^{2}+0x-4 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,4{x}^{2}+0x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n\n- the quotient is ${x}^{2}-4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $0.$" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382574 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382575 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382576 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382577 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382578 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1041 "selection" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382577 13194139536077 true] [17592186382573 1110 #uuid "200a22c6-ce4d-5cf0-a5df-fb437345b4aa" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382574 1034 "{x}^{2}+4x-1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382574 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382574 1111 #uuid "1c9525d9-2140-53d7-90a8-d77ea75019d5" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382575 1034 "{x}^{2}+4" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382575 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382575 1111 #uuid "8ce82f94-5e04-5046-9807-b07adf80e759" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382576 1034 "{x}^{2}-x-4" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382576 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382576 1111 #uuid "28875687-fbb8-5cc8-be28-4a986bd09e5a" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382577 1034 "{x}^{2}-4" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382577 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382577 1111 #uuid "e9c9bb4d-c54c-521f-986b-1dcdf890b60f" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382578 1034 "{x}^{2}-4x+1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382578 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382578 1111 #uuid "ea08d729-ddad-5ab0-963b-674e3d2a59bc" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382580 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382582 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1089 "q-325111" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1100 "Express $\\frac{-6{x}^{4}+25{x}^{3}-28{x}^{2}+x+13}{3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the remainder of the division.$$\n\n| $-6{x}^{4}+25{x}^{3}-28{x}^{2}+x+13$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4$ | __ |  |  | $3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4$ |" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1113 #uuid "0743b4b9-f377-5889-a7c9-656b1539fae1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382579 1145 "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-2x+5 \\\\  & 3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-6{x}^{4}+25{x}^{3}-28{x}^{2}+x+13\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,-\\,6{x}^{4}+10{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}-8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,15{x}^{3}-26{x}^{2}+9x+13 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{15{x}^{3}-25{x}^{2}+5x+20}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-{x}^{2}+4x-7\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $-2x+5,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-{x}^{2}+4x-7.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\frac{-6{x}^{4}+25{x}^{3}-28{x}^{2}+x+13}{3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4}=-2x+5\\,+\\,\\frac{(-{x}^{2}+4x-7)}{3{x}^{3}-5{x}^{2}+x+4}.\n$$" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382580 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382581 13194139536077 true] [17592186382580 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536077 true] [17592186382580 1041 "field-1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382580 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382581 13194139536077 true] [17592186382580 1110 #uuid "728069d7-d1d7-52f6-9d9d-fb007f8a2dc9" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382581 1034 "-2x+5" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382581 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382581 1111 #uuid "824e1247-d155-5894-ba5d-c8a68a06765e" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382582 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382583 13194139536077 true] [17592186382582 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536077 true] [17592186382582 1041 "field-2" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382582 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382583 13194139536077 true] [17592186382582 1110 #uuid "677694ea-a97d-5b32-9091-249a0c0de726" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382583 1034 "-x^2+4x-7" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382583 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382583 1111 #uuid "19797490-b808-5970-b235-e4ce63397729" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382585 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382588 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1089 "q-325150" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1100 "Express $\\frac{2{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+1}{\\,{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4\\,}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{\\,{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4\\,},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $2{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+1$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4$ | __ |  |  | ${x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4$ |" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1113 #uuid "f2706f58-1f14-5bc3-b52d-584c0d4b829e" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382584 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the $x$ term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing term with a zero coefficient, as follows:\n\n$$\n2{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+1\\,=\\,2{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+0x+1\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,2x+1 \\\\  & {x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,2{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+0x+1\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{2{x}^{4}-4{x}^{3}+2{x}^{2}-8x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}+8x+1 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}+7x+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $2x+1,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $3{x}^{2}+7x+5.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2{x}^{4}-3{x}^{3}+3{x}^{2}+1}{\\,{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4\\,} & =2x+1+\\frac{3{x}^{2}+7x+5}{{x}^{3}-2{x}^{2}+x-4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382585 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382586 13194139536077 true] [17592186382585 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382587 13194139536077 true] [17592186382585 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536077 true] [17592186382585 1041 "field-1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382585 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382587 13194139536077 true] [17592186382585 1110 #uuid "627bdb85-3e2f-5691-8725-82985cfbabf5" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382586 1034 "2x-1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382586 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382586 1111 #uuid "d941a1af-d5c9-51b5-a7a2-c3dc595810d3" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382587 1034 "2x+1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382587 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382587 1111 #uuid "30e105ec-fbe2-5831-965d-5469a2550dc8" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382588 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382589 13194139536077 true] [17592186382588 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536077 true] [17592186382588 1041 "field-2" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382588 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382589 13194139536077 true] [17592186382588 1110 #uuid "418fdad4-ad1a-5256-98e1-5532ebb66b81" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382589 1034 "3x^2+7x+5" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382589 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382589 1111 #uuid "6fba225c-a5a7-5fd9-b01c-3697a9894a62" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382591 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1017 #edb/ref 17592186382593 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1089 "q-325151" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045464 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1100 "Express $\\frac{-9{x}^{3}+22x}{\\,-3x+4\\,}$ in the form $q(x)+\\frac{r(x)}{\\,-3x+4\\,},$ where $q(x)$ is the quotient and $r(x)$ is the reminder of the division.$$\n\n| $-9{x}^{3}+22x$ | __ | {{field-1}} | $+$ | {{field-2}} |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $-3x+4$ | __ |  |  | $-3x+4$ |" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1113 #uuid "f11bd3cf-0b1a-5fb5-ae05-b3e880b91e82" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382590 1145 "Notice that the dividend is missing the ${x}^{2}$ term and the constant term. So, we first rewrite it by including the missing terms with zero coefficients, as follows:\n\n$$\n-9{x}^{3}+22x\\,=\\,-9{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+22x+0\n$$\n\nNow, using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,3{x}^{2}+4x-2 \\\\  & -3x+4\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,-9{x}^{3}+0{x}^{2}+22x+0\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-9{x}^{3}+12{x}^{2}}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-12{x}^{2}+22x+0 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{-\\,12{x}^{2}+16x}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,6x+0 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,6x-8}_{―} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAs a result, \n\n- the quotient is $3{x}^{2}+4x-2,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $8.$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{-9{x}^{3}+22x}{\\,-3x+4\\,} & =3{x}^{2}+4x-2+\\frac{8}{-3x+4}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382591 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382592 13194139536077 true] [17592186382591 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536077 true] [17592186382591 1041 "field-1" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382591 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382592 13194139536077 true] [17592186382591 1110 #uuid "40f94c77-273f-5a73-93ba-a3932799c178" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382592 1034 "3x^2+4x-2" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382592 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536077 true] [17592186382592 1111 #uuid "db3d6bc5-fa0f-564a-9e32-4e77314c6c70" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382593 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382594 13194139536077 true] [17592186382593 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045449 13194139536077 true] [17592186382593 1041 "field-2" 13194139536077 true] [17592186382593 1104 #edb